{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1th-5-1","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He proceeds in the former description of Christ's coming to judgment; 16 and gives divers precepts; 23 and so concludes the epistle.</p>\n<p>the times. Mt 24:3,36; Mr 13:30-32; Ac 1:7 ye. 4:9; 2Co 9:1; Jude 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-2","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>know. Jer 23:20 the day. Mt 24:42-44; 25:13; Mr 13:34,35; Lu 12:39,40; 2Pe 3:10; Re 3:3 Re 16:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-3","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Peace. De 29:19; Jud 18:27,28; Ps 10:11-13; Isa 21:4; 56:12; Da 5:3-6 Na 1:10; Mt 24:37-39; Lu 17:26-30; 21:34,35 then. Ex 15:9,10; Jos 8:20-22; Jud 20:41,42; 2Ch 32:19-21; Ps 73:18-20 Pr 29:1; Isa 30:13; Lu 17:27-29; 21:34,35; Ac 12:22,23; 13:41 2Th 1:9; 2Pe 2:4; Re 18:7,8 as. Ps 48:6; Isa 43:6-9; 21:3; Jer 4:31; 6:24; 13:21; 22:23; Ho 13:13 Mic 4:9,10 and they. Mt 23:33; Heb 2:3; 12:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-4","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>are. Ro 13:11-13; Col 1:13; 1Pe 2:9,10; 1Jo 2:8 overtake. De 19:6; 28:15,45; Jer 42:16; Ho 10:9; Zec 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-5","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Lu 16:8; Joh 12:36; Ac 26:18; Eph 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-6","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>let us not. Pr 19:15; Isa 56:10; Jon 1:6; Mt 13:25; 25:5; Mr 14:37; Lu 22:46 Ro 13:11-14; 1Co 15:34; Eph 5:14 watch. Mt 24:42; 25:13; 26:38,40,41; Mr 13:34,35,37; 14:38; Lu 12:37,39 Lu 21:36; 22:46; Ac 20:31; 1Co 16:13; Eph 6:18; Col 4:2; 2Ti 4:5 1Pe 4:7; Re 3:2; 16:15 sober. 8; Php 4:5; 1Ti 2:9,15; 3:2,11; Tit 2:6,12; 1Pe 1:13; 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-7","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>they that sleep. Job 4:13; 33:15; Lu 21:34,35; Ro 13:13; 1Co 15:34; Eph 5:14 and they. 1Sa 25:36,37; Pr 23:29-35; Isa 21:4,5; Da 5:4,5; Ac 2:15; 2Pe 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-8","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>who. 5; Ro 13:13; Eph 5:8,9; 1Pe 2:9; 1Jo 1:7 the breastplate. Isa 59:17; Ro 13:12; 2Co 6:7; Eph 6:11,13-18 the hope. Job 19:23-27; Ps 42:5,11; 43:5; La 3:26; Ro 5:2-5; 8:24,25 1Co 13:13; Ga 5:5; 2Th 2:16; Heb 6:19; 10:35,36; 1Pe 1:3-5,13 1Jo 3:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-9","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>not. 1:10; 3:3; Ex 9:16; Pr 16:4; Eze 38:10-17; Mt 26:24; Ac 1:20,25 Ac 13:48; Ro 9:11-23; 2Ti 2:19,20; 1Pe 2:8; 2Pe 2:3; Jude 1:4 obtain. Ro 11:7,30; 2Th 2:13,14; 1Ti 1:13,16; 2Ti 2:10; 1Pe 2:10; 2Pe 1:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-10","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>died. Mt 20:28; Joh 10:11,15,17; 15:13; Ro 5:6-8; 8:34; 14:8,9; 1Co 15:3 2Co 5:15,21; Eph 5:2; 1Ti 2:6; Tit 2:14; 1Pe 2:24; 3:18 whether. 4:13,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-11","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Wherefore. 4:18 comfort. or, exhort. Heb 3:13; 10:25 and edify. Ro 14:19; 15:2; 1Co 10:23; 14:5,12,29; 2Co 12:19; Eph 4:12,16,29 1Ti 1:4; Jude 1:20 even. 4:10; Ro 15:14; 2Pe 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-12","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>to know. 1Co 16:18; Php 2:19; Heb 13:7,17 labour. 2:9; Mt 9:37,38; Lu 10:1,2,7; Joh 4:38; Ac 20:35; 1Co 3:9; 15:10 1Co 16:16; 2Co 5:9; 6:1; 11:23; Ga 4:11; Php 2:16; Col 1:29 1Ti 5:17,18; 2Ti 2:6; Re 2:3 and are. Ac 20:28; 1Co 12:28; Tit 1:5; Heb 13:7,17; 1Pe 5:2,3; Re 1:20 Re 2:1,8,12,18; 3:1,7,14 and admonish. 14; 1Ti 5:1,20; Tit 1:3; 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-13","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>esteem. Mt 10:40; 1Co 4:1,2; 9:7-11; Ga 4:14; 6:6 and be. Ge 45:24; Ps 133:1; Mr 9:50; Lu 7:3-5; Joh 13:34,35; 15:17 Ro 4:17-19; 2Co 13:11; Ga 5:22; Eph 4:3; Col 3:15; 2Th 3:16 2Ti 2:22; Heb 12:14; Jas 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-14","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>exhort. or, beseech. Ro 12:1 you. 12 warn. Jer 6:12; Eze 3:17-21; 33:3-9; Ac 20:27,31; 1Co 4:14; Col 1:28 that. Tit 1:6,10 unruly. or, disorderly. 2Th 3:11-13 comfort. 2:7-12; Isa 35:3,4; 40:1,2,11; Eze 34:16; Mt 12:20; Lu 22:32 Joh 21:15-17; Ro 14:1; 15:1-3; Ga 6:1,2; Heb 12:12 support. Ac 20:35; *Gr: be. Isa 63:9; 1Co 13:4,5; Ga 5:22; Eph 4:2,32; 5:1,2; Col 3:12,13 1Ti 3:3; 6:11; 2Ti 2:24,25; 4:2; Heb 5:2,3; 13:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-15","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>See. Ge 45:24; 1Co 16:10; Eph 5:15,33; 1Pe 1:22; Re 19:10; 22:9 none. Ex 23:4,5; Le 19:18; 1Sa 24:13; Ps 7:4; Pr 17:13; 20:22; 24:17,29 Pr 25:21; Mt 5:39,44,45; Lu 6:35; Ro 12:17-21; 1Co 6:7 1Pe 2:22,23; 3:9 ever. 2:12; De 16:20; Ps 38:20; Ro 14:19; 1Co 14:1; 1Ti 6:11; Heb 12:14 1Pe 3:11-13; 3Jo 1:11 and. Ro 12:17,18; Ga 6:10; 2Ti 2:24; Tit 3:2; 1Pe 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-16","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Rejoice. 2Co 6:10; Php 4:4; Mt 5:12; Lu 10:20; Ro 12:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-17","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Pray. Lu 18:1; 21:36; Ro 12:12; Eph 6:18; Col 4:2; 1Pe 4:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-18","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>every. Eph 5:20; Php 4:6; Col 3:17; Job 1:21; Ps 34:1; Heb 13:15 for. 4:3; 1Pe 2:15; 4:2; 1Jo 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-19","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Quench. So 8:7; Eph 4:30; 6:16 the Spirit. Ge 6:3; 1Sa 16:4; Ne 9:30; Ps 51:11; Isa 63:10; Ac 7:51; 1Co 14:30 Eph 4:30; 1Ti 4:14; 2Ti 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-20","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>4:8; Nu 11:25-29; 1Sa 10:5,6,10-13; 19:20-24; Ac 19:6; 1Co 11:4 1Co 12:10,28; 13:2,9; 14:1,3-6,22-25,29-32,37-39; Eph 4:11,12 Re 11:3-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-5-21","title":"1 Thessalonians 5:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Prove. Isa 8:20; Mt 7:15-20;